# Local-only scratch/harness scripts: dev sign-ins, one-off dry runs against a
# dev board, authz probes that flip a coach_clients row and put it back. They
# talk to a live dev project and print real contact data, so they stay on the
# machine that ran them. Same convention as tests/jobfit-regression/.gitignore.
#
# The committed tests in this directory are the *.test.ts files, which read
# source code rather than a database.
*.local.ts
